R(11,46,'169–177','Unsigned composition law followed by a sign warning.','Check whether the statement is confined to even cohomology or has a Koszul sign.','Odd homogeneous classes acquire the usual graded permutation sign; the algebraic-cycle subring is even.')
R(11,48,'244–247','The right-unit display has a terminal class symbol whose position is unclear.','Check that the diagonal acts on the correspondence already introduced, without an extra factor.','Both unit identities follow from the same diagonal pull–push square.')
