R(56,27,'1598–1618','The reductive-centre proof ends with a deferred reference.','Check XIII versus XIV and whether the final arrow belongs to the proof.','The completed field-centre proof is XII 4.4; neighbouring regular-element arguments occur in XIII–XIV.')
R(56,31,'1706–1712','The centre quotient proof breaks off mid-sentence.','Check whether the manuscript leaf itself ends there.','XII 4.7 supplies the connected-fibre conjugation argument; its completion cannot be imported into the quotation.')

