R(55,6,'145–190','Lemma A assumes H1 vanishing but states a global module equivalence.','Check for a missing global-generation condition, while keeping the separate neighborhood-basis variant distinct.','RP2 with constant C satisfies the main written assumptions but has a nontrivial sign local system with no global sections. The later β condition repairs the conclusion.')
